1
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:09,990
Sorry if this is all I have.

2
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:15,750
The soldiers took away all my coffee and other expensive things, 
claiming they needed it for the war effort.

3
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:18,600
Have you seen the main street?

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,380
Our once beautiful city roads, 
reduced to piles of rubble.

5
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:25,130
You were unlucky to get 
caught up in all of this, Cid.

6
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:28,380
Of course, I only just opened 
an inn here myself.

7
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:31,180
<i>After leaving the Midgar Kingdom alone,</i><i></i>

8
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:35,340
<i>I wandered wherever my fancy took me 
and it gave me a chance to take another look at myself.</i><i></i>

9
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:38,350
<i>After all, this trip started 
as a journey of self-discovery.</i><i></i>

10
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,630
<i>Until now, in the situations 
I've found myself in,</i><i></i>

11
00:00:41,630 --> 00:00:44,110
<i>I did what I felt would take me closest 
to becoming the Eminence in Shadow.</i><i></i>

12
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,340
<i>But thinking back,</i>

13
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:51,070
<i>I never really had a clear image 
of what exactly that should be.</i><i></i>

14
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:55,790
<i>When stuff came up, I think I was just happy 
to do whatever kinda looked Eminence-in-Shadowy.</i>

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,250
<i>Should I really keep going 
in this direction?</i>

16
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:03,000
<i>Am I imagining it, 
or does it feel like something's missing?</i><i></i>

17
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,710
Can things really go on like this?

18
00:01:08,710 --> 00:01:10,920
No, of course not.

19
00:01:11,420 --> 00:01:13,640
We can't give up.

20
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:16,200
We must never, ever give up.

21
00:01:16,710 --> 00:01:17,810
Here you are.

22
00:01:19,250 --> 00:01:20,250
Don't mind if I do!

23
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:22,500
Hey, that was mine!

24
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:27,500
Didn't your grandma ever teach you 
not to take other people's food without permission?

25
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,860
I-I'll make you another one right away.

26
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,800
Make mine without parsley.

27
00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:33,570
<i>I have to do something.</i>

28
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,570
You're going to eat more?!

29
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:36,700
I'm sorry.

30
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:40,000
I'm so sorry.

