925
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:40,400
First Castle Town...

926
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:43,040
It used to be such a beautiful city.

927
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:46,500
But it couldn't escape the fires of war.

928
00:03:46,790 --> 00:03:51,210
I felt that, if I joined Shadow Garden, 
I could do something.

929
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:55,590
That, if I got stronger, 
I'd be able to save my kingdom.

930
00:03:55,590 --> 00:03:56,780
But I...

931
00:03:58,670 --> 00:04:00,730
Number 666, it's time.

932
00:04:00,730 --> 00:04:02,400
Hurry, hurry!

933
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,900
I'll be right out.

934
00:04:07,210 --> 00:04:10,060
Number 559 will be leading 
the mission today.

935
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:13,750
Isn't 559 the one who...

936
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:19,030
Yes, she's the eminent fighter who beat Number 89 
and won the right to challenge other Numbers.

937
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,990
Eminent...

938
00:04:21,420 --> 00:04:23,950
If there's something on your mind, 
talk to us about it.

939
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:26,910
No, it's nothing.

940
00:04:27,590 --> 00:04:29,130
Fine.

941
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:31,000
I'd like three with sauce, please!

942
00:04:31,670 --> 00:04:33,600
Is that all you think about?!

943
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:36,360
Now, now. 
Remember, this is sightseeing time.

944
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:39,200
We're supposed to do recon, not sightseeing.

945
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:45,980
The castle doesn't look all that beat up.

946
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:48,710
But the main street was a total wreck...

947
00:04:48,710 --> 00:04:49,710
You're here.

948
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:52,610
Number 559...

949
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:55,540
You know the mission parameters?

950
00:04:55,540 --> 00:04:58,100
Only in regards to Fort First.

951
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,860
Follow me.

952
00:05:02,170 --> 00:05:05,600
The stronghold fell to the Perv faction 
two days ago.

953
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:08,620
It's just a small castle town 
that should be of little importance.

954
00:05:09,310 --> 00:05:15,200
However, the Cult secretly deployed their most elite force, 
the Children of Diablos, to take it.

955
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,420
So, something's here.

956
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:20,280
Our mission is to find out 
what the Cult is after.

957
00:05:23,210 --> 00:05:24,600
Number 666.

958
00:05:26,170 --> 00:05:29,160
Do you know why you were chosen 
for this mission?

959
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:31,690
Because I'm familiar with Fort First.

960
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:35,040
The royal family uses this stronghold 
as a summer resort.

961
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,290
Isn't that right?

962
00:05:36,290 --> 00:05:37,200
Yes.

963
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,440
But that isn't the only reason.

964
00:05:39,790 --> 00:05:41,570
I requested for you intentionally...

965
00:05:42,030 --> 00:05:43,500
Rose Oriana.

966
00:05:44,570 --> 00:05:48,000
You received your powers directly 
from Lord Shadow himself.

967
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,870
Really?!

968
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,660
What an honor!

969
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,800
I did...

970
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,800
Is that not true for the two of you?

971
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:58,200
We came here under the guidance 
of the Seven Shades.

972
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,960
It's not just us.

973
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:02,060
I think pretty much everyone 
from Shadow Garden.

974
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:06,210
The only ones in the organization who got power 
straight from Lord Shadow are the Seven Shades.

975
00:06:06,210 --> 00:06:07,510
And me.

976
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:11,800
I, too, was granted power by Lord Shadow.

977
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,040
You?

978
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:17,200
Aside from the Seven Shades, 
666 and I are the only exceptions.

979
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:17,980
But...

980
00:06:18,250 --> 00:06:19,460
you are weak.

981
00:06:20,250 --> 00:06:23,210
I am Lord Shadow's loyal servant.

982
00:06:23,210 --> 00:06:25,910
I will eliminate any 
who aren't worthy of his greatness.

983
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,340
They're on the move.

984
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:33,370
Looks like there's an awful lot of them.

985
00:06:33,370 --> 00:06:35,510
What lies down that path?

986
00:06:35,510 --> 00:06:37,130
It leads to some ruins.

987
00:06:37,130 --> 00:06:40,840
They say it was a memorial to the warriors 
who fought against the Demon Diablos.

988
00:06:41,290 --> 00:06:44,880
But now, it's used as an outdoor music hall.

989
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,010
Ruins, huh?

990
00:06:52,390 --> 00:06:54,310
Kouadoi the Gale...

991
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,960
He's one of the Cult's leaders.

992
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:58,360
And his entire entourage are First Children.

993
00:06:59,210 --> 00:07:00,420
Preparations are complete.

994
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:02,000
Finally.

995
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,700
That card can't be...

996
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,880
It's just like at the Sanctuary.

997
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:30,720
Come along, Your Royal Majesty.

998
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,800
Mother?

999
00:07:37,650 --> 00:07:39,750
No... Why?

1000
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:42,170
If she's your mother, that means...

1001
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:44,320
She's the queen of Oriana, 
the one who sleâ

1002
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:44,860
Shush!

1003
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,900
Now, place your hand on the glyph.

1004
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:58,790
We were right, royal blood <i>is</i> the key.

1005
00:08:00,210 --> 00:08:03,750
This is the ring of legend 
that was once protected by the Hero Freya!

1006
00:08:04,110 --> 00:08:05,260
Prepare for combat.

1007
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:08,970
B-But I thought this was a recon mission?

1008
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:10,960
That ring is the key.

1009
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:12,950
We will eradicate them and retrieve it.

1010
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,380
What do you mean by "key"?

1011
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:15,430
You don't need to know.

1012
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:18,600
But I will say that it's crucial 
we retrieve it.

1013
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,690
Wait, please! My mother is down there!

1014
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,650
And why does that matter?

1015
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,820
Who are you?!

1016
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,450
Time for an execution.

1017
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:38,080
Why...

1018
00:08:38,290 --> 00:08:40,310
Why my mother?!

1019
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:42,790
Oh, she's done it now!

1020
00:08:42,790 --> 00:08:43,880
We should help, too!

1021
00:08:44,250 --> 00:08:45,670
Rose?

1022
00:08:45,670 --> 00:08:47,000
Rose, is that you?

1023
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,630
Why would you attack my mother?

1024
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,910
You don't need to know.

1025
00:08:52,410 --> 00:08:54,800
You people are from 
Shadow Garden, aren't you?

1026
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:58,090
It's impressive you managed 
to find out our location,

1027
00:08:58,090 --> 00:09:00,610
but you start your attack 
with a falling out among allies?

1028
00:09:00,610 --> 00:09:04,320
And as an added bonus, 
you even brought us the missing Princess Rose!

1029
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:06,900
Oh, Rose!

1030
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:08,590
I'm so scared! I'm terrified!

1031
00:09:08,590 --> 00:09:09,950
Oh, Rose!

1032
00:09:09,950 --> 00:09:13,000
Help me! You have to save me, Rose!

1033
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:19,420
Number 666!

1034
00:09:19,420 --> 00:09:22,800
It's Howard the Cyclone 
and Alphard the Headwind!

1035
00:09:23,710 --> 00:09:27,380
I knew you weren't worthy 
to serve our lord and master.

1036
00:09:25,170 --> 00:09:28,610
Help me, Rose! You have to protect me!

1037
00:09:27,710 --> 00:09:30,340
Then, you will both die at my hand!

1038
00:09:28,610 --> 00:09:30,340
Please, I beg of you!

1039
00:09:35,310 --> 00:09:40,000
The team we sent to investigate 
Fort First has engaged in battle.

1040
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:42,000
I see.

1041
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,480
Number 559 does occasionally 
have trouble restraining herself.

1042
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:49,150
Yes, and Number 666...

1043
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:52,950
Princess Rose unfortunately 
saw her mother with the Cult.

1044
00:09:53,380 --> 00:09:55,300
And what of Perv Asshat?

1045
00:09:55,300 --> 00:09:56,370
He was absent.

1046
00:09:56,370 --> 00:09:58,660
Naturally. As was the Knight Beyond Men?

1047
00:09:58,660 --> 00:09:59,710
Yes.

1048
00:10:00,290 --> 00:10:02,200
I wonder if it was all a trap?

1049
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:07,380
Ruins, the Heroes' Blood, 
and a heavy deployment of First Children...

1050
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:09,000
It was far from subtle.

1051
00:10:09,710 --> 00:10:13,920
We've been constantly interfering 
with their ruin robberies for a long time now,

1052
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,900
but he still hasn't shown himself.

1053
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:18,880
He must be a very patient man,

1054
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:23,170
this Knight Beyond Men, this Mordred, 
the Ninth Seat of Rounds.

1055
00:10:23,170 --> 00:10:28,730
That he's been able to control the Oriana Kingdom 
from the shadows for so long comes as no surprise, I suppose.

1056
00:10:28,730 --> 00:10:33,540
But that patience of his doesn't appear 
to have extended to his pawns.

1057
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:41,720
Princess Rose Returns, Citizens Revolt

1058
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:41,720
Princess Rose Returns, Citizens Revolt

1059
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:36,710
Perv Asshat does seem 
to be growing quite restless.

1060
00:10:36,710 --> 00:10:42,000
He has expended a large number of pawns in his attempts 
to investigate the ruins and keep us in check.

1061
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,920
Now that he's being required 
to deal with civil unrest,

1062
00:10:42,020 --> 00:10:48,000
Ruling Forced Through, Conservative Revolt Inevitable?

1063
00:10:42,020 --> 00:10:48,000
Ruling Forced Through, Conservative Revolt Inevitable?

1064
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:48,000
security around the Oriana capital 
has lightened considerably.

1065
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:51,310
This will be a good time to send in 
a large number of reinforcements.

1066
00:10:51,310 --> 00:10:53,380
Have Lambda speed up 
the organization of troops.

1067
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:53,970
Right away.

1068
00:10:53,970 --> 00:10:56,580
As for Princess Rose, 
we'll let the Cult have her.

1069
00:10:56,580 --> 00:11:02,930
Very well, but this will increase the likelihood that Perv Asshat 
and his puppetmaster Mordred will make their move.

1070
00:11:03,210 --> 00:11:06,900
That would work out 
very nicely for us, as well.

1071
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:13,120
As soon as Princess Rose stepped onto 
the stage with us and the Cult,

1072
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,800
that set everything in motion.

1073
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:19,490
And it was the will of our lord 
to lead the princess to this point.

1074
00:11:19,710 --> 00:11:23,400
You could even say 
he's the one who set up the board.

1075
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:29,340
Which makes me wonder, 
how does he envision the end of this game?

1076
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,300
<i>Apparently, the Oriana Kingdom 
has no one available to inherit the throne,</i>

1077
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:38,890
<i>and there's a conflict between the newly formed pro-Perv faction 
and the anti-Perv, Old Regime faction.</i>

1078
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:41,380
<i>Factional disputes, war...</i>

1079
00:11:40,310 --> 00:11:42,000
Good morning, Cid.

1080
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:43,000
<i>It's every man's dream.</i><i></i>

1081
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:50,110
<i>Surely there's somewhere in all that 
where an Eminence in Shadow can step in and look really cool.</i><i></i>

1082
00:11:50,110 --> 00:11:51,290
Here you are.

1083
00:11:51,290 --> 00:11:53,070
I'll get your breakfast right away.

1084
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:56,390
<i>They haven't crowned a new ruler yet, huh?</i><i></i>

1085
00:11:56,390 --> 00:11:58,820
Maybe I should help with that.

1086
00:11:59,710 --> 00:12:03,830
Thank you for offering, 
but I'll be fine without any help.

1087
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:08,340
<i>The Oriana Kingdom is rocked by factional disputes 
after the death of its king.</i>

1088
00:12:08,340 --> 00:12:13,000
<i>The strife is quelled by a new ruler, 
guided to victory by a mysterious personage.</i><i></i>

1089
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,770
<i>An unidentified eminence 
who lurks in the shadows of history.</i><i></i>

1090
00:12:16,770 --> 00:12:18,840
<i>I like it! I like it a lot.</i>

1091
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,970
<i>That's what we call a "fixer move".</i><i></i>

1092
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:25,930
<i>If Oriana needs a new ruler, 
then Rose seems like the perfect candidate, but...</i>

1093
00:12:26,250 --> 00:12:27,460
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

1094
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:29,750
<i>why did she murder her father, anyway?</i>

1095
00:12:29,750 --> 00:12:33,510
<i>Was she that unhappy at the idea 
of being betrothed to that pervert?</i><i></i>

1096
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,070
<i>That can't be it.</i><i></i>

1097
00:12:35,310 --> 00:12:39,000
<i>She had this look back then, 
like she was prepared to do anything.</i><i></i>

1098
00:12:39,570 --> 00:12:44,080
Would you keep believing in me, 
no matter what happens?

1099
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:47,790
<i>The resolve to kill her own father 
if that's what it took to be queen...</i>

1100
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:51,710
<i>The determination to walk the path of carnage, 
to become a supreme tyrant...</i>

1101
00:12:51,710 --> 00:12:54,550
<i>Who am I not to believe in that?</i><i></i>

1102
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:57,460
<i>As a background character, 
and as the Eminence in Shadow,</i>

1103
00:12:57,460 --> 00:13:00,420
<i>I will help Rose become the next monarch.</i>

1104
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:02,260
<i>And after she's become the mighty tyrant,</i>

1105
00:13:02,260 --> 00:13:05,220
<i>Rose will eventually stand before the heroes, 
blocking their way.</i>

1106
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:08,400
<i>But someone will step in between them.</i><i></i>

1107
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:11,210
<i>The tyrant's former benefactor, 
the Eminence in Shadow.</i><i></i>

1108
00:13:11,210 --> 00:13:15,190
<i>And what's more, they were once bosom buddies 
who used to talk of their dreams together.</i><i></i>

1109
00:13:15,190 --> 00:13:17,510
Yes, it's delectable.

1110
00:13:17,510 --> 00:13:20,030
Okay, I get it. I'll get you another one.

1111
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:22,790
<i>Now that that's worked out, 
I'd better get ready toâ</i><i></i>

1112
00:13:23,490 --> 00:13:26,450
It's collection time!

1113
00:13:26,450 --> 00:13:31,670
We humbly offer the good citizens of this town 
the right to support their government's army.

1114
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:33,420
So lady, where's your safe?

1115
00:13:33,420 --> 00:13:36,130
You can't! You took everything I had 
just the other day!

1116
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:38,690
Oh, looks like there's still plenty left.

1117
00:13:38,690 --> 00:13:40,820
I need that to cover expenses!

1118
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:43,000
Hey, you can donate this keg!

1119
00:13:42,380 --> 00:13:45,710
This is a time to go back to my roots.

1120
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,710
Stop! That's all the spirits I have left!

1121
00:13:45,710 --> 00:13:47,100
Shut up, lady!

1122
00:13:47,100 --> 00:13:50,350
Y'know, I wouldn't mind 
if you wanted to pay with your body.

1123
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:53,100
Oh, make sure to leave some for me.

1124
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:54,860
S-S-Stop!

1125
00:13:55,400 --> 00:14:02,400
Y-You leave Miss M-M-Mary alone!

1126
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,960
Man, that was hilarious!

1127
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:09,000
Ah, the foibles of youth...

1128
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,120
Let's take this money and grab a pint!

1129
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,380
Cid!

1130
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:14,180
You shouldn't be so reckless!

1131
00:14:14,180 --> 00:14:16,840
I'm shorry...

1132
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:20,800
Dey got away wid all yer money.

1133
00:14:22,290 --> 00:14:24,210
I'll be just fine.

1134
00:14:24,210 --> 00:14:26,760
Believe it or not, 
I used to be a prostitute in the Lawless City.

1135
00:14:27,290 --> 00:14:31,000
I had to deal with violent customers 
on a daily basis.

1136
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:35,230
I came so close to giving up so many times, 
but I could never bring myself to do it.

1137
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:39,710
I'm sure that's why I got help... from <i>him</i>.

1138
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:43,010
And now, you rescued me, too.

1139
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:48,090
Well, I'll be leaving.

1140
00:14:48,090 --> 00:14:51,040
Are you sure? Maybe you should wait 
until you've healed.

1141
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:53,090
Dere's shomething I need to do.

1142
00:14:53,090 --> 00:14:54,330
But never mind dat, lemme payâ

1143
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:57,920
That's all right. I owe you for saving me.

1144
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:59,100
Are you shure?

1145
00:14:59,100 --> 00:15:00,710
All right. Goodbye, den.

1146
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:03,100
Yes, I hope to see you again.

1147
00:15:06,250 --> 00:15:10,970
<i>They made a dashing entrance, 
showed off their power, and made a dashing exit.</i><i></i>

1148
00:15:10,970 --> 00:15:14,940
<i>I don't know who that was, 
but some people just get it.</i><i></i>

1149
00:15:15,540 --> 00:15:18,330
<i>I can't let them outdo me.</i>

1150
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:19,940


1151
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:25,860
<i>Why do I feel like I'm getting nowhere?</i>

1152
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,040
<i>Over the last few days,</i>

1153
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:32,330
<i>I've tried so many things to get a foothold towards making 
the "Birth of Tyrant Rose" a thing, but...</i><i></i>

1154
00:15:33,090 --> 00:15:35,040
<i>I began by sneaking into 
a correctional facility.</i><i></i>

1155
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:38,880
<i>And while savoring the life of a prisoner, 
something I'd always wanted to try,</i>

1156
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:42,840
<i>I observed the intrigue swirling around the prison 
with all its thrills and suspense!</i><i></i>

1157
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:45,800
<i>Then, we made a spectacular jailbreak!</i><i></i>

1158
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:48,760
<i>And I went straight 
into joining the volunteer army.</i><i></i>

1159
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:52,220
<i>They said we couldn't possibly lose, 
but we barely got out with our lives.</i>

1160
00:15:52,220 --> 00:15:55,710
<i>It was a good opportunity to recreate one of 
the legends told through Oriana's history,</i>

1161
00:15:55,710 --> 00:15:57,190
<i>so I helped out from the shadows.</i>

1162
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:00,650
<i>But I guess I went a little overboard,</i><i></i>

1163
00:16:00,650 --> 00:16:05,070
<i>because, in the end, a bunch of old dudes 
I'd never met ended up with all the glory.</i><i></i>

1164
00:16:05,380 --> 00:16:07,070
This isn't how it's supposed to go.

1165
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:12,610
A fixer is supposed to, like, 
stand out by not standing out when standing out, y'know?

1166
00:16:13,670 --> 00:16:16,080
I knew we were right to pick this side!

1167
00:16:16,390 --> 00:16:19,000
I heard they're losing ground 
on the western front.

1168
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,540
And some garbage about 
the legend coming back to life?

1169
00:16:21,540 --> 00:16:22,840
Speaking of the legend,

1170
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:25,790
I heard something like that 
happened around these parts, too.

1171
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:29,930
Yeah, apparently they found an enormous treasure 
in the ruins on the other side of the mountains.

1172
00:16:29,930 --> 00:16:30,960
Treasure?

1173
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:33,890
Don't even think about it. 
Ignorance is bliss.

1174
00:16:33,890 --> 00:16:37,310
The higher-ups have been acting 
really weird these last few days.

1175
00:16:37,710 --> 00:16:41,710
If we wanna get out of this alive, 
it's about time we get while the getting's good.

1176
00:16:41,710 --> 00:16:43,000
Oh, that reminds me.

1177
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:46,250
While we're on our way out, 
whaddya say we pick up a few women as souvenirs?

1178
00:16:46,250 --> 00:16:48,700
How about that girl at the inn...

1179
00:16:52,110 --> 00:16:53,160
Who the hell are you?!

1180
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:56,270
When you want something, take it, 
even if you have to kill for it.

1181
00:16:56,900 --> 00:16:59,110
Don't you just love 
the rules of the Lawless City?

1182
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,710
I know I do.

1183
00:17:01,310 --> 00:17:03,670
Basically, it means 
the strongest guy is always right.

1184
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:08,220
And that makes me right.

1185
00:17:20,250 --> 00:17:21,810
It's hopeless.

1186
00:17:21,810 --> 00:17:24,940
Forget about this month's rent, 
I can't even stock up for tomorrow.

1187
00:17:26,310 --> 00:17:27,780
Oh, Cid...

1188
00:17:28,410 --> 00:17:31,900
I wish I'd swallowed my pride 
and asked him to pay up.

1189
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:37,200
After all that, 
I'm gonna have to sell this again.

1190
00:17:54,590 --> 00:17:58,000
It's... It's a bag of coins...

1191
00:18:13,170 --> 00:18:15,290
You've been watching over me...

1192
00:18:16,590 --> 00:18:17,910
Shadow.

1193
00:18:22,790 --> 00:18:25,130
First you defeat Heat Blast and Windstorm,

1194
00:18:25,130 --> 00:18:26,750
now Dry Wind and Cool Breeze...

1195
00:18:27,390 --> 00:18:28,840
You monster!

1196
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:31,810
Every one of my reinforcements 
was a First Child!

1197
00:18:31,810 --> 00:18:35,680
And you fought against them without rest 
for three days and three nights!

1198
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:43,020
But I see even your magic power 
can't last forever.

1199
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:45,270
You had to make this so difficult.

1200
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:51,570
Cheer up, I won't merely kill you.

1201
00:18:52,090 --> 00:18:54,570
I will torture you to death, 
along with every member of your team.

1202
00:18:55,290 --> 00:18:57,790
I'll start with an arm or a leg...

1203
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:59,580
Despite it all, I am grateful.

1204
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:04,540
After all, now I've obtained 
the key <i>and</i> Rose Oriana.

1205
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:07,460
If I play these cards right, 
I can climb above Perv Asshat,

1206
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:09,000
and become the next Knight of Rounds!

1207
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:14,490
It's you...

1208
00:19:15,050 --> 00:19:17,640
You've come to save me again!

1209
00:19:19,510 --> 00:19:20,810
What?!

1210
00:19:28,730 --> 00:19:30,750
Impossible, her arm healedâ

1211
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:33,070
No, she grew another one!

1212
00:19:33,410 --> 00:19:35,780
It's all thanks to <i>him</i>.

1213
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:36,660
It's his power!

1214
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,420
Lord Shadow...

1215
00:19:43,420 --> 00:19:47,000
You are the ray of moonlight 
that pierces the darkness!

1216
00:19:47,410 --> 00:19:49,810
I wish you would take me and...

1217
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:57,290
I'm healed...

1218
00:19:57,290 --> 00:19:59,000
It's a miracle.

1219
00:19:59,380 --> 00:20:03,180
But what is our lord doing here?

1220
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:08,130
Lord Shadow, it's good to see you again!

1221
00:20:08,130 --> 00:20:09,060
The treasâ

1222
00:20:09,060 --> 00:20:10,630
The ruins, are they through here?

1223
00:20:11,210 --> 00:20:13,190
I'm afraid I must report.

1224
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:16,150
It's about the traitor, Number 666.

1225
00:20:16,420 --> 00:20:18,090
Number 666?

1226
00:20:18,090 --> 00:20:21,170
That woman has betrayed Shadow Garden.

1227
00:20:21,170 --> 00:20:23,380
Is that an employee ID number?

1228
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:25,600
She is not worthy of you, Lord Shadow.

1229
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:27,290
Please, give me the order to eliminateâ

1230
00:20:27,290 --> 00:20:28,000
No, wait!

1231
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:28,870
Please, hold on!

1232
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,210
She was trying to save her mother!

1233
00:20:31,210 --> 00:20:33,510
And as a result, the key was stolen.

1234
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:36,500
She has committed a serious crime.

1235
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:38,600
Did someone steal some 
Mitsugoshi company secret or something?

1236
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:38,600
She must atone with her death.

1237
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:39,390
Death?

1238
00:20:39,390 --> 00:20:40,970
What is your problem?!

1239
00:20:41,210 --> 00:20:42,860
You keep going off about this key!

1240
00:20:42,860 --> 00:20:45,710
Do we need it so badly that we have to stomp 
all over our friend's feelings?

1241
00:20:45,710 --> 00:20:47,930
You do not need to know.

1242
00:20:47,930 --> 00:20:52,610
I've had my fill of corporations 
and betrayal for a while.

1243
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:52,040
And she is not our friend. 
She's a filthy traitor.

1244
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:54,460
Filthy? What is wrong with you?

1245
00:20:54,460 --> 00:20:56,190
You've been trying to pick a fight 
this whole mission!

1246
